<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins $2.00 higher;</p>
<p>butts 2.00-3.00 higher; skinned hams steady to 2.00 higher;</p>
<p>seedless bellies generally 4.00-6.00 higher; fresh lean trimmings</p>
<p>steady to 1.00 higher.</p>
<p>Trading slow to moderate, with moderate demand and light</p>
<p>offerings. - USDA</p>
